===
\[H_\infty = \frac{p}{\beta mk}.\] On the other hand, for very small values of \(\tau\) the initial maxima for \(\beta\tau = \pi\), may attain the value \[H_0 = \frac{p}{\beta mk} (1 + e^{-\alpha\tau}).\] If the pressure \(p\) changes its sign whenever \(\cos @@A@@
