\[H = \frac{p}{\beta mk} \cdot \frac{1 + e^{-\alpha\tau}}{1 - e^{-\alpha\tau}} \cdot (1 - e^{-(n+1)\alpha\tau}).\]

This expression shews the reinforcement, increasing with every change of sign, which ensues upon the coincidence of the period of change of pressure with @@A@@
