\[H = \frac{H_0}{1 - e^{-\alpha\tau}}.\]

APPENDIX X.

RELATION BETWEEN THE STRENGTH OF SYMPATHETIC RESONANCE AND THE LENGTH OF TIME REQUIRED FOR THE TONE TO DIE AWAY.

(See pp. 113a and 142d.)

Retain the notation of App. IX., for the motion of a heavy point, reduced @@A@@
